
# PJN Technologies Inventory Management System

## Project Overview

This project was developed using Odoo Community Edition.

The system manages:

* Product Inventory
* Stock Tracking
* Purchase Orders
* Vendor Management
* Inventory Reports

## Modules Used

* Inventory
* Purchase

## Features

* Product Management
* Warehouse Management
* Stock Quantity Tracking
* Purchase Order Processing
* Vendor Management
* Inventory Reporting

## Tools & Technologies

* Odoo Community 19
* PostgreSQL
* Python
* GitHub

## Project Workflow

Vendor
→ Purchase Order
→ Receive Products
→ Inventory Stock Updated
→ Reporting

## Author

Abdul Hazeez
